usage: verify_audio_capture_session_end_to_end.py [-h] --port PORT
                                                  [--device-name DEVICE_NAME]
                                                  [--boot-timeout-seconds BOOT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS]
                                                  [--ble-connect-timeout-seconds BLE_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS]
                                                  [--notify-ready-timeout-seconds NOTIFY_READY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS]
                                                  [--capture-seconds CAPTURE_SECONDS]
                                                  [--timeout-seconds TIMEOUT_SECONDS]
                                                  --artifacts-dir
                                                  ARTIFACTS_DIR
                                                  [--trigger-mode {serial-toggle,physical-key}]
                                                  [--no-reset-before-capture]

Verify EC11/toggle session WAV capture using the current BLE session path.
This replaces the retired serial ACAP/PCM64 export verification.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --port PORT
  --device-name DEVICE_NAME
  --boot-timeout-seconds BOOT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
  --ble-connect-timeout-seconds BLE_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
  --notify-ready-timeout-seconds NOTIFY_READY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
  --capture-seconds CAPTURE_SECONDS
  --timeout-seconds TIMEOUT_SECONDS
  --artifacts-dir ARTIFACTS_DIR
  --trigger-mode {serial-toggle,physical-key}
  --no-reset-before-capture
